    "main_finding": "Correcting the h=1 iid DM defect to canonical lag-13 Bartlett HAC changes every legacy t-statistic but none of the seven legacy |t|>3 classifications. Final statistics additionally repair the Taiwan-open return window, nightly round-trip costs, and weekend session parsing; their directions are generated from dm_results above. Only same-base comparisons are claim-bearing. Squared-return risk loss alone does not establish total strategy improvement.",
